    </description>
    <baseline year="2017">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.No Forest Sector Transformation Unit; 
2.No Awareness of the Mandate of the Forest Sector Transformation Unit; 
3.No Standard Operating Procedures / Implementation Manuals;
4.No Monitoring and Evaluation Protocol; 
5 No Gender or Social Inclusion Plan for REDD+ Implementation Plan;
6.No land use plan;
7. Absence of baselines data about the restoration areas;
8.Inadequate enclosure management plan; 
9.inadequate baseline information for the areas to be restored</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
